{"3834760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ganymede", "steam_appid": 3834760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sci-fi exploration platformer originally developed for the GameTank open-source 8-bit console now made available as a PC game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something has gone very wrong on one of Jupiter's moons, and an otherwise mundane mirning outpost has been overrun with giant mutant bugs! It's up you and your trusty lightblade to search the passages beneath Bio Dome 1 to find the cause of this apparent alien incursion and ill-fated first contact.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sci-fi exploration platformer originally developed for the GameTank open-source 8-bit console now made available as a PC game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something has gone very wrong on one of Jupiter's moons, and an otherwise mundane mirning outpost has been overrun with giant mutant bugs! It's up you and your trusty lightblade to search the passages beneath Bio Dome 1 to find the cause of this apparent alien incursion and ill-fated first contact.</p>", "short_description": "Hack and slash your way through a space station overrun with aggressive alien creatures. Collect upgrade orbs to extend your abilities and conquer convoluted movement puzzles.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834760/500f3c3e8632a7f224899f24ef66e4f226103445/header.jpg?t=1774525548", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834760/dae1ae273e139e9319585b3a42490ab5e09d2700/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774525548", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834760/dae1ae273e139e9319585b3a42490ab5e09d2700/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774525548", "website": null, "pc_requirement